          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You draw water from the environs, swirling it into a rough torrent around you to punish your foes. Each creature in a @Template[emanation|distance:10] (or @Template[emanation|distance:15]{15 feet} if you're in a body of water) takes @Damage[8d6[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. A creature that fails its save is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. At 17th level, the damage increases to 11d6.</p>"
          },
